{:doc ["New-DSL conversion of ac/combat/abilities/scatter_bomb.edn (S6). Session"
        "ability. Two new language gaps and two real content bugs found while"
        "porting."
        ""
        "Gaps:"
        "- each's optional [item index] binding (old :flow/foreach's"
        "  :index-as) -- see node-core/compile.clj's own docstring for"
        "  compile-each."
        "- :vec3/scatter-end, referenced under the :vec3/* namespace but"
        "  genuinely needing the activation's RNG cursor for its random cone"
        "  deviation -- an exhaustive search found no implementation anywhere"
        "  (the same never-wired-up-reference class :vec3/launch turned out to"
        "  be), so it is a NEW node, cn.li.combat.dsl-vocabulary's"
        "  :kernel/scatter-end, not a port."
        ""
        "?charge/ticks is :double (run.clj's fixed-capabilities), not :long --"
        "next-spawn-tick's own computation (charge-ticks + spawn-interval-ticks)"
        "needs math/floor-long, not long/add, to narrow the double sum back down"
        "to the :long the state field is declared."
        ""
        "Bugs (both the same \\\"stale re-add\\\" class the RELEASE-side double-"
        "spend bugs already found this session belong to): the old :pulse's"
        "spawn-branch vfx :update read {:ref [:state :balls]} (already live-"
        "updated to balls+1 by an earlier same-activation write, per the"
        "pattern groundshock.edn/directed_blastwave.edn's docstrings"
        "established) and added ANOTHER +1 on top, so the displayed ball count"
        "would have been balls+2, one higher than the real count; and that"
        "same vfx :update was ALSO fired a second, redundant time right after"
        "the branch regardless of whether a ball spawned. Both use sites"
        "collapsed into the two branches of a single `if`, each using its own"
        "correct just-computed count once."
        ""
        "The `if`/`set!` shape for `destination` (rather than a math/select"
        "expression) is required, not stylistic: the auto-aim branch is pure"
        "(vec3/add on already-known fields) but the scatter branch is a real"
        "host query (kernel/scatter-end), and a call cannot appear in"
        "math/select's expression-position args -- the same rule that also"
        "forces random/int into its own `let` elsewhere. destination is"
        "predeclared with a placeholder vec3 and reassigned via set! in"
        "whichever arm actually runs, the same accumulator pattern"
        "apply_break_budget.edn's set! usage already established."]
 :schema-version 2
 :kind :ability
 :id :scatter-bomb
 :name-key "ability.skill.meltdowner.scatter_bomb"
 :description-key "ability.skill.meltdowner.scatter_bomb.desc"
 :revision 2
 :activation :session
 :requires [:caster/eye :caster/aim :caster/id :world/id :charge/ticks]
 :tunables {:max-balls {:curve :const :type :int}
            :max-hold-ticks {:curve :const :type :int}
            :spawn-interval-ticks {:curve :const :type :int}
            :spawn-start-tick {:curve :const :type :int}
            :scatter-range {:curve :const}
            :scatter-angle-degrees {:curve :const}
            :damage {:curve :mastery-lerp}
            :auto-aim-exp-threshold {:curve :const}
            :auto-aim-radius {:curve :const}
            :anti-afk-tick {:curve :const :type :int}
            :anti-afk-damage {:curve :const}
            :cost-down-overload {:curve :mastery-lerp}
            :cost-tick-cp {:curve :mastery-lerp}
            :exp-per-ball {:curve :const}}
 :costs {:activate {:resources {:overload {:ref [:input :tunables :cost-down-overload]}}}
         :charging {:resources {:cp {:ref [:input :tunables :cost-tick-cp]}}}}
 :progression {:ball-fired {:per-mark {:ref [:input :tunables :exp-per-ball]}}}
 :session-state {:balls {:type :int :default 0}
                 :next-spawn-tick {:type :int :default 0}
                 :overload-floor {:type :float :default 0.0}
                 :ball-ids {:type :any :default []}}
 :program
 "{:ability :scatter-bomb
   :activation :session
   :state {:balls {:type :long :default 0} :next-spawn-tick {:type :long :default 0}
           :overload-floor {:type :double :default 0.0} :ball-ids {:type :any :default []}}
   :tunables {:cost-down-overload {:type :double} :spawn-start-tick {:type :long}
              :anti-afk-tick {:type :long} :anti-afk-damage {:type :double}
              :max-balls {:type :long} :max-hold-ticks {:type :long}
              :spawn-interval-ticks {:type :long} :auto-aim-radius {:type :double}
              :damage {:type :double} :scatter-range {:type :double}
              :scatter-angle-degrees {:type :double} :auto-aim-exp-threshold {:type :double}}
   :phases
   {:start
    [(let activate-budget ?budget/activate)
     (let sufficient? (cost/spend {:budget activate-budget}))
     (if sufficient?
       [(state! :balls 0)
        (state! :ball-ids [])
        (let resources ?context/resources)
        (state! :overload-floor (math/sub (:overload resources) $cost-down-overload))
        (state! :next-spawn-tick $spawn-start-tick)
        (let eye ?caster/eye)
        (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :spawn
              :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb] :audience {:type :nearby :radius 32.0}
              :payload {:position eye :rate-per-tick 2 :limit 128
                       :particle {:material :additive :life-ticks 10 :speed 0.04}}})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :audio-one-shot :operation :spawn
              :audience {:type :nearby :radius 32.0}
              :payload {:position eye :sound-id \"academy:md.sb_charge\" :volume 0.5
                       :pitch 1.0}})
        (finish {:outcome :started})]
       [(finish {:outcome :insufficient-resource :end-ability? true})])]

    :pulse
    [(let charge-ticks ?charge/ticks)
     (let anti-afk? (math/eq charge-ticks $anti-afk-tick))
     (if anti-afk?
       [(let wid ?world/id)
        (let owner-id ?caster/id)
        (combat/damage {:world-id wid :target owner-id :amount $anti-afk-damage
                        :damage-type :generic})
        (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
              :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb] :payload {}})
        (finish {:outcome :anti-afk :next-phase :release})]
       [(let charging-budget ?budget/charging)
        (let charge-sufficient? (cost/spend {:budget charging-budget}))
        (if charge-sufficient?
          [(let overload-floor %overload-floor)
           (resource/enforce-floor {:resource :overload :minimum overload-floor})
           (let next-spawn-tick %next-spawn-tick)
           (let balls %balls)
           (let can-spawn?
             (bool/and (math/gte charge-ticks next-spawn-tick)
                      (bool/and (math/lt balls $max-balls)
                               (math/lte charge-ticks $max-hold-ticks))))
           (let eye ?caster/eye)
           (if can-spawn?
             [(let wid ?world/id)
              (let owner-id ?caster/id)
              (let spawn-result
                (entity/spawn {:world-id wid :entity-type \"academy:entity_md_ball\"
                               :add-tags [\"ac_scatter_bomb\"] :owner owner-id :position eye
                               :velocity [0.0 0.0 0.0] :life-ticks 2333333
                               :barrier? true}))
              (let spawned-ball-id (:entity-id spawn-result))
              (let ball-ids-next (collection/concat %ball-ids [spawned-ball-id]))
              (state! :ball-ids ball-ids-next)
              (let balls-next (long/add balls 1))
              (state! :balls balls-next)
              (state! :next-spawn-tick (math/floor-long (math/add charge-ticks $spawn-interval-ticks)))
              (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :update
                    :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb]
                    :payload {:position eye :balls balls-next}})]
             [(vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :update
                    :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb]
                    :payload {:position eye :balls balls}})])
           (finish {:outcome :continue})]
          [(vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
                 :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb] :payload {}})
           (finish {:outcome :insufficient-resource :end-ability? true})])])]

    :release
    [(let eye ?caster/eye)
     (let aim ?caster/aim)
     (let owner-id ?caster/id)
     (let wid ?world/id)
     (let ball-ids %ball-ids)
     (let balls-list
       (target/entities {:shape {:type :sphere :center eye :radius 4.0}
                         :filter {:entity-types [\"academy:entity_md_ball\"]
                                 :required-tags [\"ac_scatter_bomb\"] :owner-id owner-id
                                 :entity-ids ball-ids}
                         :limit $max-balls}))
     (let auto-targets
       (target/entities {:shape {:type :sphere :center eye :radius $auto-aim-radius}
                         :filter {:living? true} :limit 64}))
     (let skill-exp ?context/skill-exp)
     (let auto-aim-limit (math/floor (math/mul %balls skill-exp)))
     (each [ball ball-index] balls-list
       (entity/discard {:world-id wid :entity ball})
       (let auto-target (data/random-item {:items auto-targets}))
       (let should-auto-aim?
         (bool/and (math/gt skill-exp $auto-aim-exp-threshold)
                  (bool/and (math/lt ball-index auto-aim-limit) (:id auto-target))))
       (let destination [0.0 0.0 0.0])
       (if should-auto-aim?
         [(set! destination (vec3/add (:position auto-target) [0.0 (:eye-height auto-target) 0.0]))]
         [(set! destination (kernel/scatter-end {:origin eye :direction aim
                                                 :range $scatter-range
                                                 :angle-degrees $scatter-angle-degrees}))])
       (projectile/schedule-beam {:world-id wid :owner owner-id :origin (:position ball)
                                  :destination destination :damage $damage :damage-type :magic
                                  :delay-ticks 1})
       (vfx! {:effect-id :beam-fade-audio :operation :spawn
             :audience {:type :nearby :radius 64.0}
             :payload {:sound-position (:position ball) :fade-at 4 :sound-pitch 1.0
                      :duration-ticks 14 :sound-volume 0.45 :fade-layers []
                      :beam-at 0 :start (:position ball) :sound-id \"academy:md.sb_ray_small\"
                      :fade-to-tick 14 :fade-from-alpha 1.0
                      :layers [{:shape :tube :radius 0.08 :color [236 170 93 60]}
                              {:shape :tube :radius 0.05 :color [241 240 222 200]}
                              {:shape :line :width 0.015 :color [165 230 255 160]}]
                      :grow-ticks 2 :fade-to-alpha 0.0 :end destination :fade-from-tick 4}})
       (let ball-fired-progression ?progression/ball-fired)
       (event! {:type :score/mark :tag :ball-fired :progression ball-fired-progression}))
     (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb] :payload {}})
     (finish {:outcome :released :end-ability? true})]

    :abort
    [(let owner-id ?caster/id)
     (let wid ?world/id)
     (let body ?caster/body)
     (let ball-ids %ball-ids)
     (let remaining-balls
       (target/entities {:shape {:type :sphere :center body :radius 4.0}
                         :filter {:entity-types [\"academy:entity_md_ball\"]
                                 :required-tags [\"ac_scatter_bomb\"] :owner-id owner-id
                                 :entity-ids ball-ids}
                         :limit $max-balls}))
     (each ball remaining-balls
       (entity/discard {:world-id wid :entity ball}))
     (vfx! {:effect-id :particle-session :operation :destroy
           :instance-key [:activation :scatter-bomb] :payload {}})
     (finish {:outcome :aborted :end-ability? true})]}}"
 :cooldown nil
 :invariants nil
 :mark-policies nil}
